<Layout title="Publisher Policy · Foresight Labs"><section class="page-intro container"><p class="eyebrow">Effective 30 July 2026</p><h1>For the people<br />who <em>publish.</em></h1><p>AURA uses RSS and Atom feeds to help readers find and organise journalism. Original publishers remain the authoritative source.</p></section><section class="section"><div class="container content"><h2>Attribution stays attached</h2><p>Publisher content belongs to its respective rights holders. AURA retains source attribution and links to the original article, and inclusion does not imply endorsement or partnership.</p><h2>Removal and corrections</h2><p>Rights holders may request feed removal or attribution correction. Please include the publication, feed URL, relevant article or feed details, and the requested action.</p><p><a href="mailto:thisisaritrasaha@gmail.com?subject=AURA%20Publisher%20Removal%20Request">Email an AURA Publisher Removal Request ↗</a></p></div></section></Layout>
